---
import { Heart } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section class="py-12 bg-stone-beige">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="bg-warm-white rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-12 shadow-sm">
      <!-- Header with Icon -->
      <div class="flex items-center mb-8">
        <div
          class="w-16 h-16 bg-forest-canopy rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-6 flex-shrink-0"
        >
          <Heart className="w-8 h-8 text-white" aria-hidden="true" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-earth-brown">
          Our Non-Discrimination Policy
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Policy Text (preserves IRS Rev. Proc. 75-50 / 2019-22 required wording) -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-8">
        <p class="text-earth-brown leading-relaxed-plus mb-6">
          Spicebush Montessori School admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic
          origin, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation,
          disability or ability, or family and socioeconomic background (within the age range served
          by our licensed early childhood programs) to all the rights, privileges, programs, and
          activities generally accorded or made available to students at the school. It does not
          discriminate on the basis of race, color, national and ethnic origin, ancestry, religion,
          sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, disability or ability, or family
          and socioeconomic background in administration of its educational policies, admissions
          policies, scholarship and loan programs, and athletic and other school-administered
          programs.
        </p>

        <p class="text-earth-brown leading-relaxed-plus mb-6">
          Below are ways to reach out to the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services&apos;
          Office for Civil Rights, the Pennsylvania Department of Human Services Bureau of Equal
          Opportunity, the Pennsylvania Human Relations Commission, or our school directly if you
          have been subjected to implicit bias or discrimination.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Links -->
      <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.hhs.gov/civil-rights/filing-a-complaint/index.html"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block text-lg font-bold text-forest-canopy hover:text-moss-green transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-canopy focus:ring-offset-2 rounded px-2 py-1"
          >
            U.S. HHS Office for Civil Rights
            <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dhs/departments-offices/oa-info/oa-bureau-equal-opportunity"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block text-lg font-bold text-forest-canopy hover:text-moss-green transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-canopy focus:ring-offset-2 rounded px-2 py-1"
          >
            PA DHS Bureau of Equal Opportunity
            <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </a>
          <p class="text-sm text-earth-brown/80 mt-0.5">
            Phone: <a href="tel:7177871127" class="underline hover:text-forest-canopy"
              >(717) 787-1127</a
            > &bull; Email: <a
              href="mailto:RA-PWDHSCIVILRIGHTS@pa.gov"
              class="underline hover:text-forest-canopy">RA-PWDHSCIVILRIGHTS@pa.gov</a
            >
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center">
          <a
            href="https://www.pa.gov/agencies/phrc"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block text-lg font-bold text-forest-canopy hover:text-moss-green transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-canopy focus:ring-offset-2 rounded px-2 py-1"
          >
            Pennsylvania Human Relations Commission
            <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </a>
          <p class="text-sm text-earth-brown/80 mt-0.5">
            Phone: <a href="tel:7177874410" class="underline hover:text-forest-canopy"
              >(717) 787-4410</a
            > &bull; Email: <a href="mailto:PHRC@pa.gov" class="underline hover:text-forest-canopy"
              >PHRC@pa.gov</a
            >
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feedback Form -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <p class="text-earth-brown text-center">
          If you would like to submit a complaint or offer feedback to teachers and school leaders
          without sharing your name or email, please use our
          <a
            href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd9x0mdbCKXBjbWuVme2SeRX9enMfUAf7Y_80VqFUDFs4qfRg/viewform?usp=sf_link"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-forest-canopy hover:text-moss-green font-bold transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-canopy focus:ring-offset-2 rounded px-1"
          >
            feedback form hosted on Google Forms
            <span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
          </a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Direct Contact CTA -->
      <div
        class="bg-gradient-to-r from-forest-canopy to-moss-green text-center py-6 px-8 rounded-xl shadow-md"
      >
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="text-white text-lg font-semibold hover:text-light-stone transition-colors focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-forest-canopy rounded px-2 inline-block"
        >
          Contact Spicebush Montessori directly to report implicit bias or discrimination
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
